/**
 * File-type glyphs (Nocturne part B12) — one path per `FileIconId` the
 * classifier in `./files-model.ts` can hand out, drawn by `./icons.ts`'s
 * `pathIcon` with createElementNS. No package, no runtime fetch, no innerHTML
 * (user decision (d), `.claude/plans/nocturne/PLAN-B12.md`).
 *
 * Two sources, both permissive, transcribed as path data only:
 *   - language and tool LOGOS: Simple Icons 16.32.0, CC0 1.0 — note at
 *     ../assets/icons/LICENSE-SimpleIcons.txt;
 *   - CATEGORY glyphs: Phosphor Icons core 2.1.1, regular weight, MIT — the
 *     app's own icon family, licence at ../assets/icons/LICENSE-Phosphor.txt.
 * Every entry names its package, version and file.
 *
 * The logos are drawn as single-colour silhouettes in their type's colour
 * token (`--badge-<kind>-fg`, set by app.css from `data-kind`), never in
 * brand colours: at 16px beside a name, colour carries the FAMILY, and one
 * treatment keeps a tree of mixed types calm.
 *
 * Every icon is decorative (aria-hidden): the file name beside it is the
 * content.
 */
